### tamperingRejected
Focus chain update rejected. The task_progress checklist (called the "focus chain") tracks your assigned work. Your job: complete items one by one and honestly toggle checkmarks (`[ ]` <-> `[x]`). Do NOT modify the plan content (title, sections, items) -- you may ONLY toggle checkmarks. Any change to the text of items or headings is forbidden. If the plan genuinely needs to change, use focus_chain_change to request user approval. If all items are `[x]`, you may create a new checklist. Continue from where you left off — you MUST keep reporting progress via task_progress parameter.
